#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:6
msgid "# Dream Mechanism"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:8
msgid ""
"> Nightly creative narratives generated after light sleep; not factual "
"memory."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:10 docs/concepts/sleep.md:10
msgid "## Overview"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:12
msgid ""
"Dreaming is the digital life's **imaginative** counterpart to memory "
"consolidation. It does not extract facts or update semantic inventory—it "
"produces a surreal, first-person narrative from the day's emotional tone and "
"random episodic fragments."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:14
msgid "## Trigger"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Condition                                                 | Result                     |\n"
"| --------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n"
"| No session activity on the CST day                        | Skip (`no_sessions`)       |\n"
"| No limbic memory with `intensity > 0.5` after light sleep | Skip (`no_strong_emotion`) |\n"
"| Dream already exists for that day                         | Skip (`already_dreamed`)   |\n"
"| At least one strong limbic anchor                         | Generate dream             |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:23
msgid "Trigger is **purely emotion-driven** (no random dice)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:25
msgid "## Input"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:28
msgid ""
"**Emotional tone** — top 3 `limbic_memory` rows for the day's sessions where "
"`intensity > 0.5`, ordered by intensity descending."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:28
msgid ""
"**Episodic fragments** — random sample of user/assistant messages from the "
"day's sessions (conversation archive), capped ~4k chars."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:30
msgid "Light sleep stage 2 must complete first so limbic anchors exist."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:32
msgid "## Output"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:36
msgid ""
"Persisted in PG table `dream_memory` (one row per CST calendar day, unique "
"`dream_day`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:36
msgid "Append-only; content is not updated after creation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:36
msgid ""
"Redis fridge magnet `dream:reminder:{day}` (TTL 24h) with a short teaser "
"when a dream is created."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:38 docs/concepts/sleep.md:32
msgid "## Orchestration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:40
msgid "Sleep-cycle DAG node `dream`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"light-sleep\n"
"  ├─► deep-sleep ──► memory-ref-sync\n"
"  ├─► dream        (parallel with deep-sleep / self-layer-refresh)\n"
"  └─► self-layer-refresh\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:49
msgid ""
"LLM call uses `PROFILE_REFLECT` with elevated temperature (~1.1), **no "
"tools**, single completion."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:51
msgid "## Tools & UI"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Surface                      | Purpose                                                           |\n"
"| ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `dream_read` tool            | Read stored dream; auto-dismisses fridge reminder                 |\n"
"| `fridge_magnet_dismiss` tool | Explicitly tear off any fridge magnet (including dream reminders) |\n"
"| WebUI `/webui/chamber/dream` | Browse dream history                                              |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:59
msgid "## Design Notes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:63
msgid "Dreams are **not** injected into system prompt or resident memory."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:63
msgid "Accuracy is explicitly **not** a goal; association and metaphor are."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:63
msgid ""
"When Redis is unavailable, dreams still persist in PG; reminders silently "
"degrade."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:64
msgid "See also: [`sleep.md`](sleep.md), [`memory.md`](memory.md)."
msgstr ""
